  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of Samtredia-Grigoleti-Kobuleti section of the East-West Highway of Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Upgrade and improvement of the most Western part of the East-West highway, from Zestaponi to Adjara region in Georgia for a total length of about 68 km. The highway is on the Pan-European corridor linking the EU with Central Asia through Georgia. Its rehabilitation will improve the conditions of the main road corridor available for transportation of goods between Asia and Europe.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
